flowchart LR
	SCOPES["the scopes object gating every arm of hook-dsh-normalize-dash independently<br/>the defaults exactly the pre-scopes behavior"]
	CONV["conversation, on by default<br/>text-delta text + the assembled text/reasoning blocks"]
	REAS["reasoning, on by default<br/>the reasoning-delta sub-gate ANDed with normalizeReasoning"]
	TIN["toolInput, off by default<br/>OR-ed with normalizeToolArguments<br/>the only execution-critical arm"]
	TRES["toolResults, off by default<br/>the tools/post-execute arm"]
	FILES["files, on by default<br/>inert in a stream flavor"]
	BATCH["batch, off by default<br/>the agent/pre-step arm"]
	MARK["arguments opening with the {'__normalize':false} FIRST-key marker<br/>pass through unnormalized, the marker entry stripped"]
	EXEMPT["the edit, raw-write and normalize-file calls<br/>structural exemptions, never rewritten"]
	EXEMLIST["toolResultsExempt, volatile - a tool result whose exec name<br/>is listed passes the tool-results arm by identity"]
	VOL["the whole object volatile - one leaf change commits<br/>one loader/volatile-update dispatch"]
	READER["the State's refresh listener re-reads the whole object<br/>live, silent, no remount, no new activation line"]
	SCOPES --> CONV
	SCOPES --> REAS
	SCOPES --> TIN
	SCOPES --> TRES
	SCOPES --> BATCH
	SCOPES -. "inert in a stream flavor" .-> FILES
	TIN -. "the per-call escape hatch" .-> MARK
	TIN -. "structural exemptions" .-> EXEMPT
	TRES -. "by identity" .-> EXEMLIST
	SCOPES --> VOL
	VOL --> READER
